  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 1609.01 Operator Steps Assigned Upon Original Certification",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 1609.01 Operator Steps Assigned Upon Original Certification. Individuals shall obtain step designations based on the number of total continuing professional development hours accumulated over the course of the individual’s certification, as described in Env-Sw 1609.02.\n\nSource. #10600, eff 7-1-14; ss by #12045, eff 11-18-16; ss by #13623, eff 5-1-23",
